      "writtenOn": "2026-02-03T18:36:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The naming pattern comes from the std library when accepting a va_list directly vs the variadic version (printf -\u003e vprintf). https://cplusplus.com/reference/cstdio/vprintf/\n\nBut if we have another naming convention, I\u0027d much rather switch to it. Done.",
